// Bandit Level 27 → Level 28

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 27 server:

        ssh bandit27@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 26.

Step3: The challenge gives us a Git repository:

        ssh://bandit27-git@bandit.labs.overthewire.org/home/bandit27-git/repo

Step4: The repository is available through SSH on port `2220`.

Step5: We should clone the repository on our own machine, not inside the Bandit server.

Step6: Create a temporary directory:

        mkdir /tmp/bandit27
        cd /tmp/bandit27

Step7: Clone the repository:

        git clone ssh://bandit27-git@bandit.labs.overthewire.org:2220/home/bandit27-git/repo

Step8: When Git asks for a password, enter the Bandit Level 27 password.

Step9: Enter the cloned repository:

        cd repo

Step10: List the files:

        ls

Step11: We can see:

        README

Step12: Read the README:

        cat README

